WEBVTT

00:00:02.510 --> 00:00:04.460
Wow, they're so pretty!

00:00:05.990 --> 00:00:07.990
Thank you very much.

00:00:07.990 --> 00:00:10.850
I'm certain the flowers are pleased as well.

00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:15.280
Alice, haven't you always been part of the school's Gardening club?

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:16.050
Yes.

00:00:16.810 --> 00:00:18.660
Do you like raising flowers?

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:22.870
My childhood dream was to become a florist.

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:23.990
What about now?

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:29.660
Well, I'll have to succeed my father's company,

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:32.260
so I won't be able to pursue that dream.

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:36.190
Oh...

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:41.560
Then we'll make it come true <i>for</i> you!

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:44.030
{OP}

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:50.220
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:52.690
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:00:53.060 --> 00:00:55.560
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:57.600
Every day it sparkles

00:00:57.760 --> 00:01:01.270
Dokidoki Precure

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:08.200
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:01:08.780 --> 00:01:13.870
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:01:14.030 --> 00:01:19.480
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:24.930
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:01:25.790 --> 00:01:30.630
If your friends are in trouble

00:01:30.850 --> 00:01:39.520
isn't it normal to help them?

00:01:39.510 --> 00:01:41.170
Happy lucky Precure

00:01:41.170 --> 00:01:43.580
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:01:43.810 --> 00:01:46.410
Our happy love will change the world

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:49.220
What's more than just cute

00:01:49.520 --> 00:01:53.090
is our promise between girls

00:01:53.890 --> 00:01:59.130
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:05.030
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:02:15.980 --> 00:02:17.590
We're done!

