Alice's Floral Arrangements

00:02:17.590 --> 00:02:20.100
"Alice's Floral Arrangements"! Sounds nice, huh?

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:21.390
It's wonderful!

00:02:21.720 --> 00:02:26.500
Opening a flower shop in a flea market was a great idea! {I thought this line was about capitalist economics until I realized that "flea" and not  "free"}

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:27.470
Yeah!

00:02:28.010 --> 00:02:32.000
I'm overjoyed to finally realize my childhood dream!

00:02:32.310 --> 00:02:34.100
Good luck, manager!

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:36.810
Thanks!

00:02:37.110 --> 00:02:39.970
I'm a manager too!

00:02:39.970 --> 00:02:43.040
Do you know what a manager does?

00:02:44.270 --> 00:02:46.560
I dunno!

00:02:47.980 --> 00:02:50.620
Cosmos, geranium, cyclamen...

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:55.280
Why not showcase more extravagant flowers?

00:02:55.570 --> 00:02:57.540
Because I like these.

00:02:57.540 --> 00:03:02.030
There's a certain beauty to flowers blooming in their season.

00:03:04.650 --> 00:03:05.430
Oh?

00:03:05.810 --> 00:03:09.550
I thought I saw a pack of stray orangutans at first,

00:03:09.550 --> 00:03:11.770
but I see it's just Alice's friends.

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:13.110
Look who's here.

00:03:13.110 --> 00:03:14.970
Who might you be?

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:19.010
From the family that forever one-ups the Yotsubas, {Kanji pun - Yotsuba =  four leaves, Itsutsuboshi - five stars, and five is more than four. It's  sadly impossible to translate without translating their names.}

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:21.640
I am the rose of the Itsutsuboshis, {Slow down, this isn't Heartcatch.}

00:03:23.060 --> 00:03:24.990
Itsutsuboshi Reina!

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:30.630
Are you participating in the flea market as well, Reina?

00:03:30.630 --> 00:03:32.010
But of course!

00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:35.010
Your little flower stall might win you some publicity,

00:03:35.010 --> 00:03:38.300
but one-upping you at every turn is my sworn duty as Itsutsuboshi Reina!

00:03:38.930 --> 00:03:47.130
<i>I've</i> raised exquisite, luxurious flowers from the four seasons over in an enormous greenhouse,

00:03:47.130 --> 00:03:49.230
and today, they will prove to be your match!

00:03:49.230 --> 00:03:50.920
Round 1, fight!

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:53.350
Take a look over there!

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:58.780
Reina's

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:58.780
Flowers

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:58.780
Premium

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:58.780
Noblesse

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:58.780
Noblesse

00:03:58.780 --> 00:04:01.910
Reina's Premium Flowers, Noblesse.{This may or may not be a pun on a brand of nose tissues.}{the name was too long for the sign and also redundant AKA deal with it}

00:04:02.910 --> 00:04:04.470
How wonderful!

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:07.720
We can be florists together!

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:16.030
Alice's Dream!

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:16.030
Alice's Dream!

00:04:18.760 --> 00:04:20.800
Would you like some flowers?

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:23.920
Come on, take a look!

00:04:24.670 --> 00:04:25.700
Um...

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:26.520
Yes?

00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:30.280
Well, I need to get some flowers for my girlfriend's birthday...

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:32.210
In that case,

00:04:33.810 --> 00:04:36.130
perhaps this geranium would suit your needs?

00:04:36.510 --> 00:04:37.780
Just a moment!

00:04:38.660 --> 00:04:42.700
If you want a gift for a lover, what could be better then red roses?

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:48.640
We sell premium quality roses, and you get 30 for the price of 1!

00:04:49.230 --> 00:04:51.680
Well, don't mind if I do...

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:53.310
Come again!

00:04:55.780 --> 00:04:58.550
It's as though the match is already settled, wouldn't you agree?

00:04:59.050 --> 00:05:02.150
You're selling luxury flowers for next to nothing!

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:03.750
That's a cheap trick! {Pun unintended, honest.}

00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:05.720
Your tactics are underhanded!

00:05:05.710 --> 00:05:08.190
I'd expect nothing less...

00:05:08.180 --> 00:05:11.700
than such beautiful flowers from you, Reina.

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:14.000
Seems you know your place.

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:16.230
Indeed, you should expect nothing less.

00:05:16.220 --> 00:05:18.330
Now, continue praising me!

00:05:20.770 --> 00:05:23.100
Would you like some flowers?

00:05:23.360 --> 00:05:25.800
We're not getting any customers...

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:27.880
And then there's our competition...

00:05:27.870 --> 00:05:29.390
Now now, don't push!

00:05:29.390 --> 00:05:30.880
Single file, people!

00:05:31.540 --> 00:05:34.110
Don't be down. Just keep trying!

00:05:35.420 --> 00:05:36.120
Hello.

00:05:38.740 --> 00:05:40.450
Would you like some flowers?

00:05:40.850 --> 00:05:42.040
Flowers, huh?

00:05:46.300 --> 00:05:48.710
I'll... take a look.

00:05:48.710 --> 00:05:50.600
Please do. They're all in season.

00:06:00.150 --> 00:06:01.480
Those are cosmos.

00:06:01.480 --> 00:06:05.840
They send my heart aflutter whenever I see them.

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:09.570
I'll have these, then.

00:06:09.570 --> 00:06:10.180
Certainly!

00:06:11.920 --> 00:06:13.560
Here you are!

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:15.930
I feel a bit better now. Thanks.

00:06:16.960 --> 00:06:19.130
Thank you very much!

00:06:19.390 --> 00:06:20.580
We did it!

00:06:20.580 --> 00:06:24.300
Alice, you were like a real florist!

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:27.240
Really? Why, thank you!

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:31.840
A real florist gives love along with each flower.

00:06:32.260 --> 00:06:35.760
I'd like to give a flower like that to Regina.

00:06:35.760 --> 00:06:37.450
I don't need no flowers.

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:40.010
Regina!

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:44.090
But doesn't looking at flowers make you happy?

00:06:44.370 --> 00:06:45.610
I told you before.

00:06:45.610 --> 00:06:47.140
I have no mercy...

00:06:47.140 --> 00:06:50.060
for things more beautiful than I.

00:06:53.790 --> 00:06:56.490
I can't fly my RC plane with this flea market here!

00:06:58.080 --> 00:07:00.730
Those flowers could die for all I care.

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:07.140
Well, my mom would probably like flowers for Mother's Day...

00:07:09.390 --> 00:07:12.140
Just those flowers die.

00:07:13.390 --> 00:07:14.980
Wh-Who said that?

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:19.750
I'll turn you into a splendid Selfish!

00:07:35.010 --> 00:07:36.170
But how?!

00:07:37.050 --> 00:07:38.330
What the?

00:07:44.910 --> 00:07:47.010
Is it a Selfish?

00:07:47.010 --> 00:07:50.060
But I didn't hear a dark heartbeat!

00:07:57.670 --> 00:08:00.190
Oh, my poor flowers...

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:11.550
Reina, as long as they still have but one green leaf,

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:14.000
they can still come back to life!

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:17.760
Let's treat them immediately!

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:24.370
Clean the roots in water.

00:08:25.780 --> 00:08:29.630
Leave only the unwithered roots to lighten the plant's burden.

00:08:30.620 --> 00:08:32.970
Plant it in new soil...

00:08:32.970 --> 00:08:34.370
And give it water.

00:08:38.260 --> 00:08:42.000
All that's left is to wait and hope for their recovery.

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:44.330
Perhaps, but why?

00:08:45.430 --> 00:08:48.180
Why help me after how mean I've been to you?

00:08:49.110 --> 00:08:53.950
You're the one who taught me how to treat plants in emergencies.

00:08:55.370 --> 00:09:02.160
And I know how much love you pour into your flowers.

00:09:02.820 --> 00:09:05.140
Ever since we first met, in fact.

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:07.400
Itsutsuboshi Rose Garden

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:17.150
Those roses are pretty.

00:09:17.150 --> 00:09:19.280
Not as pretty as me.

00:09:19.960 --> 00:09:21.750
Do you like flowers?

00:09:21.740 --> 00:09:25.150
Flowers make me look even more beautiful.

00:09:25.150 --> 00:09:27.920
That's why I raise them with care.

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:31.330
Um...

00:09:31.330 --> 00:09:32.960
What?

00:09:33.940 --> 00:09:35.680
My gazanias...

00:09:35.980 --> 00:09:39.160
Oh no, they're wilting!

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:43.060
But I don't know what to do...

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:44.720
Really...

00:09:44.720 --> 00:09:47.890
Amateurs are always such a bother!

00:09:47.890 --> 00:09:53.380
I'll show you how to treat them in emergencies, so listen up!

00:09:55.110 --> 00:10:00.210
And you've been a dear friend to me ever since.

00:10:00.510 --> 00:10:02.080
Friend?

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:02.990
Yes!

00:10:16.590 --> 00:10:19.810
<i>But in truth, I want friends too...</i>

00:10:25.370 --> 00:10:27.790
D-Don't be a fool!

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:36.540
Why's she crying?

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:40.550
Sometimes, people cry when they're happy.

00:10:42.140 --> 00:10:43.330
Madam.

00:10:44.670 --> 00:10:47.630
I've learned what's causing the flowers to wilt.

00:10:48.280 --> 00:10:50.830
The Yotsuba satellite has been commandeered.

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:55.600
This is a video of the stratosphere above the city.

00:10:56.330 --> 00:11:00.650
This Selfish is spreading Egogy seeds to make the flowers wilt!

00:11:02.270 --> 00:11:03.850
Regina!

00:11:03.850 --> 00:11:08.480
She was too far away for us to feel a dark heartbeat!

00:11:09.050 --> 00:11:11.380
We need to stop her, and fast!

00:11:11.380 --> 00:11:14.450
But how do we get above the stratosphere?

00:11:14.830 --> 00:11:16.780
We have only one way!

00:11:20.480 --> 00:11:24.600
Your flowers will certainly return to life as well.

00:11:25.210 --> 00:11:26.300
Alice...

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:43.860
Condition, normal. Systems, all green.

00:11:44.460 --> 00:11:47.630
So, Alice can fly an aircraft, too?

00:11:47.630 --> 00:11:48.320
Alice!

00:11:48.730 --> 00:11:51.140
Is there no way we can come with you?

00:11:52.170 --> 00:11:54.630
This shuttle only supports one person.

00:11:56.910 --> 00:11:57.610
Liftoff!

00:12:28.190 --> 00:12:29.160
Target sighted!

00:12:29.160 --> 00:12:30.800
It's a Selfish!

00:12:31.090 --> 00:12:32.920
Wilt!

00:12:34.160 --> 00:12:35.730
Autopilot, on!

00:12:36.180 --> 00:12:38.110
Lance, I'm ready!

00:12:40.640 --> 00:12:42.940
Lance!

00:12:43.960 --> 00:12:46.690
Precure Love Link!

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:47.600
L-O-V-E!

00:12:47.600 --> 00:12:48.310
L-O-V-E!

00:12:48.310 --> 00:12:48.930
L-O-V-E!

00:12:48.930 --> 00:12:50.070
L-O-V-E!

00:13:07.990 --> 00:13:09.790
The warmth of the sun,

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:12.220
Cure Rosetta!

00:13:17.640 --> 00:13:20.850
What, just Yellow?

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:24.550
Regina, please stop making the flowers wilt!

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:26.340
When pigs fly.

00:13:27.090 --> 00:13:30.330
Looking at flowers makes humans happy, right?

00:13:30.920 --> 00:13:32.460
Have you ever wondered why?

00:13:32.760 --> 00:13:33.860
Huh?

00:13:33.860 --> 00:13:35.260
Like I care!

00:13:35.630 --> 00:13:37.960
Because flowers contain life!

00:13:40.810 --> 00:13:44.760
Even if a flower wilts down to its final leaf...

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:48.240
it will still struggle to live against all odds!

00:13:48.240 --> 00:13:52.600
Don't you find that as beautiful as any flower in full bloom?

00:13:53.940 --> 00:14:00.230
I know your heart can accept beauty for what it is!

00:14:00.780 --> 00:14:02.700
I believe in you!

00:14:04.150 --> 00:14:05.520
What's your point?

00:14:05.910 --> 00:14:08.830
Please, accept this love!

00:14:12.440 --> 00:14:13.260
Love?

00:14:17.480 --> 00:14:18.640
That junk again?

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:20.620
Wilt...

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:26.280
Fall...

00:14:32.820 --> 00:14:36.390
If love means so much to you, then burn to a crisp along with it!

00:14:40.320 --> 00:14:42.480
<i>Reina, I'm sorry...</i>

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:46.300
<i>My love wasn't strong enough...</i>

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:50.200
<i>But at least let this cosmos...</i>

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:54.810
<i>That's it.</i>

00:14:55.130 --> 00:14:57.280
<i>As long as I have my life,</i>

00:14:57.610 --> 00:15:00.140
<i>I cannot give up!</i>

00:15:09.440 --> 00:15:10.880
What's this?

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:12.150
Cure Rosetta!

00:15:15.670 --> 00:15:16.530
Girls!

00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:18.490
How did you get here?

00:15:23.110 --> 00:15:24.400
Reina! {What good are propellers in the vacuum of space}

00:15:26.140 --> 00:15:27.200
Alice...

00:15:27.200 --> 00:15:29.210
or, should I say, Cure Rosetta.

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:39.730
I, Itsutsuboshi Reina, will fly to the ends of the earth for a friend in need!

00:15:39.730 --> 00:15:44.620
Besides, the Itsutsuboshi Conglomerate's solar plane allows everyone to ride with me!

00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:47.590
Thank you.

00:15:48.010 --> 00:15:50.470
I should be the one thanking you.

00:15:51.370 --> 00:15:56.760
I was only so mean to you before because I wanted to be your friend...

00:15:57.440 --> 00:16:02.320
And to think you considered me your friend this whole time!

00:16:02.860 --> 00:16:05.020
Yes, ever since we first met!

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:08.980
Girls!

00:16:09.470 --> 00:16:12.580
This may be all I can do for you,

00:16:12.580 --> 00:16:16.250
but please, take good care of my friend!

00:16:17.110 --> 00:16:18.050
Gotcha!

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:22.770
'Scuse me, Mana.

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:26.930
Could we talk for a bit?

00:16:26.930 --> 00:16:29.330
Sure, as long as you want!

00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:37.880
I wanna talk a bunch with you, too!

00:16:38.280 --> 00:16:41.600
You know, this whole "playing friends" thing...

00:16:41.600 --> 00:16:43.360
<i>really</i> ticks me off!

00:16:45.480 --> 00:16:47.190
Wilt!

00:16:48.960 --> 00:16:50.660
Rosetta Reflection!

00:16:54.230 --> 00:16:55.680
Are you all right?

00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:57.630
Thanks, Cure Rosetta!

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:02.070
I'll blow you all away!

00:17:06.600 --> 00:17:07.510
Thanks!

00:17:15.680 --> 00:17:16.780
Cure Ace!

00:17:17.100 --> 00:17:19.790
Wilt!

00:17:36.330 --> 00:17:37.850
I did it!

00:17:37.850 --> 00:17:41.780
Now, make a giant seed that'll wilt every flower on Earth...

00:17:42.460 --> 00:17:44.810
and those stupid Precures along with them!

00:17:45.140 --> 00:17:47.290
It wilt be done!

00:17:48.980 --> 00:17:52.110
Wilt 'em all!

00:17:58.920 --> 00:18:00.790
It's futile.

00:18:00.790 --> 00:18:03.090
But how far will you go?

00:18:05.950 --> 00:18:07.110
You can't!

00:18:07.110 --> 00:18:10.010
If you use any more power...

00:18:10.010 --> 00:18:14.650
you'll lose all that remains of your life force, Cure Rosetta!

00:18:16.080 --> 00:18:18.540
I will not lose.

00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:20.220
You moron!

00:18:20.220 --> 00:18:23.650
You can't do squat just by protecting!

00:18:23.650 --> 00:18:25.420
It doesn't matter!

00:18:26.150 --> 00:18:27.020
Say what?

00:18:27.020 --> 00:18:30.990
Just having flowers will bring people smiles.

00:18:31.520 --> 00:18:35.960
Mana, Reina, and the rest of the girls are like flowers to me.

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:42.430
So what I <i>can</i> do is protect them as much as I can!

00:18:43.800 --> 00:18:44.910
And also...

00:18:45.180 --> 00:18:49.110
you're another flower I must protect, Regina!

00:18:51.040 --> 00:18:52.280
Shut up!

00:18:52.280 --> 00:18:54.010
Go away!

00:18:58.660 --> 00:19:00.050
Alice!

00:19:00.340 --> 00:19:04.260
Cosmos has a meaning in the language of flowers...

00:19:06.430 --> 00:19:08.690
It stands for a maiden's purity.

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:13.220
I know that deep down, your heart is pure.

00:19:13.220 --> 00:19:16.850
And I know that it's brimming with love!

00:19:31.520 --> 00:19:32.740
<i>Not again...</i>

00:19:32.740 --> 00:19:35.220
<i>My chest is tingling with warmth...</i>

00:19:41.620 --> 00:19:43.460
Sadface... {literally says "Shobon." This is a literal translation.}

00:19:44.040 --> 00:19:45.330
Girls, let's go!

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:05.000
Precure Royal Lovely Straight Flush!

00:20:18.270 --> 00:20:21.380
Love love looooove!

00:20:27.140 --> 00:20:32.010
Regina's heart really is brimming with love.

00:20:33.420 --> 00:20:35.980
I'm super <i>duper</i> mad!

00:20:55.110 --> 00:20:57.980
Take this as a symbol of our friendship.

00:20:57.980 --> 00:20:59.550
Thank you very much.

00:20:59.550 --> 00:21:00.740
Please, have this.

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:04.490
Isn't that nice?

00:21:04.490 --> 00:21:08.410
But <i>I'm</i> Alice's bestest friend!

00:21:09.340 --> 00:21:11.930
It was fun being a florist!

00:21:11.930 --> 00:21:12.630
Indeed!

00:21:13.070 --> 00:21:17.000
And I think I've made a new dream.

00:21:17.620 --> 00:21:19.060
A new dream?

00:21:19.430 --> 00:21:20.340
Yes.

00:21:20.340 --> 00:21:25.840
Until now, I've only had a vague desire to protect people's smiles,

00:21:25.840 --> 00:21:30.210
but I did know that it could only be done with the power of love.

00:21:30.200 --> 00:21:31.640
Only with...

00:21:31.640 --> 00:21:33.370
The power of love?

00:21:33.740 --> 00:21:37.780
Flowers, despite their frailty, bring smiles with their mere presence...

00:21:37.780 --> 00:21:42.350
I want to protect things like them with the power of love.

00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:48.820
That's why I'll raise the Yotsuba Conglomerate to grow ever bigger!

00:21:49.170 --> 00:21:50.510
Madam...

00:21:51.650 --> 00:21:55.990
I'd like to give Regina the power of love, too...

00:21:56.380 --> 00:22:01.640
Yes, and I'd like to help you in any way I can.

00:22:26.920 --> 00:22:28.260
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.260 --> 00:22:31.400
A Celebration With Everyone!

00:22:28.260 --> 00:22:31.400
A Celebration With Everyone!

00:22:31.400 --> 00:22:33.530
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
